digraph account_payable_process_198 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the senior accountant in your department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the senior accountant in your department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_G5EM" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_G5EM"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_G5EM" -> "stamp all documents"
		"create voucher for the documents" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_G5EM" -> "create voucher for the documents"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_G7GO" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"stamp all documents" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_G7GO"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_G7GO" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"check dates to avoid penalty charges" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_G7GO" -> "check dates to avoid penalty charges"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_G7GO" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_G7GO"
		"check dates to avoid penalty charges" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_G7GO"
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_F04Q" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create voucher for the documents" -> "OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_F04Q"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_F04Q" -> "schedule the payment"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_F04Q" -> "store in paid invoice file"
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_F04Q" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"schedule the payment" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_F04Q"
		"store in paid invoice file" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_F04Q"
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_G5EM" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_G7GO" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_G5EM"
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_F04Q" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_G5EM"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the senior accountant in your department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_G5EM" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the senior accountant in your department. 
After sending to the senior accountant in your department, creating a receiving report needs to be done. 
After creating a receiving report, you need to confirm all documents have been amended.
Once confirming all documents have been amended occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: stamping all documents, creating voucher for the documents. 
After stamping all documents, the process is split into 2 parallel branches: entering the invoice into the accounts payable account and checking dates to avoid penalty charges. 
Once creating voucher for the documents occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: scheduling the payment, storing in paid invoice file. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the Accounts Receivable process and begins when you mail your senior accountant to your department.
After sending to the senior accountant in your department, creating a receiving report needs to be done.
After creating a receipt report, you must confirm all documents have been amended.
After confirmation that all documents have been modified, one or more of the following paths should be executed : stamping all documents, creating a voucher for the documents.
After stamping all documents, the process is split into two parallel branches: entering the invoice into the Accounts payable and checking dates to avoid penalty charges.
Once creating the voucher for the documents occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: scheduling the payment, and storing it in the bill file.
The process is now completed.
"
}
